BEGIN_HYPERDESC
<h1>Losing the focus vessel</h1>
With the damage model on (the test sets ORBITER_DAMAGE=1) the focus
Delta-glider, dropped flat from 150 m, breaks up: it stays the focus
vessel as a hidden ghost moving with the largest piece of its wreck, which
the camera follows. Switching to another vessel removes the ghost.
END_HYPERDESC

BEGIN_ENVIRONMENT
  System Sol
  Date MJD 51982.6685767396
  Script Tests/FocusLossTest
END_ENVIRONMENT

